{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122780/extras/DescTop.png?t=1746564852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ITribe - tribal survival strategy. Start the path of your tribe from the primitive era. Develop settlements, get resources and fight the enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122780/extras/Resources.png?t=1746564852\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> interact with resources for mining or create builds for resources. Also get experience for that and exchange it for new technologies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122780/extras/Units.png?t=1746564852\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">units with different types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122780/extras/Animals.png?t=1746564852\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">also additional units can spawn on the farms</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122780/extras/MultipleInteract.png?t=1746564852\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">combine units with constructions or each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122780/extras/builds.png?t=1746564852\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>buildings different types: rock, sand, wood etc</strong>  <br>Build buildings for which there are enough materials. Part of buildings can be use for spawn special units, constructions or upgrade.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://